>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_resource_existence_check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_tag_closed_check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_markdownlint</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck_style</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_e23f8bc15c384904957116b2e0923217/b756988e75e4285300028bb1dae0b7de?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck_precommit</strong></td>\n                        <td>⚠️ WARNING</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=669b4d37f09c4c088c393fdbf0f50b93&pipelineRunId=cd34e38fba884b6f985ab7209598e252&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/7051/pre-commit.txt>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>SCA</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/personalScandTaskInfor/person/a8cd675a-9282-49a5-b54b-b84761f0ad9b?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-07-06 10:37:24] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-07-06T10:37:20+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T10:37:24+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178681398,"discussion_id":"90c1c29b03d36157ea9423af4e80545484c5e40f","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `ctc_loss_v2_grad` 算子的 `UpdateLcabCompute` 函数中的一个控制流错误。在新增的\"减少计算量\"判断逻辑中，当满足跳过条件时，原代码错误地使用了 `return` 导致整个函数提前退出，而非仅跳过当前循环迭代。此修复将其改为 `continue`，确保循环能继续处理后续元素。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`loss/ctc_loss_v2_grad/op_kernel/arch35/ctc_loss_v2_grad.h`**: 在 `UpdateLcabCompute` 函数的循环体内，将提前退出分支的 `return;` 更正为 `continue;`，使跳过逻辑仅影响当前迭代而非终止整个函数执行。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T11:51:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T11:51:36+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178682604,"discussion_id":"fcf203abf65dce8510c1e2ab700b148c1a1bf491","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n**已审查文件：**\n- `loss/ctc_loss_v2_grad/op_kernel/arch35/ctc_loss_v2_grad.h` — 发现 1 个问题\n\n**按优先级统计：**\n| 优先级 | 数量 |\n|--------|------|\n| P0     | 0    |\n| P1     | 1    |\n| P2     | 0    |\n| P3     | 0    |\n\n**整体风险评估：** 该 diff 将 `UpdateLcabCompute` kernel 函数中 `for` 循环体内的 `return;` 修正为 `continue;`，修复了一个会导致线程提前退出、丢失大量梯度计算的正确性缺陷。这是一个极小的单字符修改，修复方向正确无误，与文件中其他 kernel 的同类模式一致，整体风险很低。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 1 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 0 |\n\n⛔ 需要修改\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T11:57:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T11:57:05+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178682608,"discussion_id":"c8e1ee9ef6d216c55366de800288ce64bc899467","body":"\uD83D\uDFE0 **High Priority**\n\n在 `UpdateLcabCompute` kernel 函数中，`for` 循环（第 207 行）以 `index += block_num * blockDimX` 的跨步方式为每个线程分配多个 `(b, t)` 索引对。第 217 行的条件判断用于跳过当前 `(b, t)` 对（当 `t >= inputLength` 或 zeroInfinity 模式下 nll 为 INFINITY 时）。\n\n原代码使用 `return;`，导致当**任意一个** `(b, t)` 对触发跳过条件时，该线程直接退出整个函数，丢弃了该线程未被处理的其余所有 `(b, t)` 对。由于每个线程被分配了多个跨步的索引，这会造成大量梯度计算遗漏，最终导致 CTC loss 梯度计算结果错误。\n\n修复将其改为 `continue;`，仅跳过当前迭代，线程继续处理后续分配给它的索引对。这与同文件中其他 kernel（`CalGradCompute` 第 181 行、`LogBetaCompute` 第 282 行）使用 `continue` 的模式一致。\n\n触发条件：可变长度序列处理中，当某个 batch 的 `inputLength` 小于 `maxInputLength` 时必然触发；zeroInfinity 模式下序列 NLL 为 INFINITY 时也会触发。\n\n**建议**：已修复：将 `return;` 改为 `continue;`，确保线程仅跳过当前迭代而继续处理后续分配的索引对。","created_at":"2026-07-06T11:57:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T16:41:26+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"686897034ce6f320c9b6c8a1","login":"huang-qiang","object_id":"686897034ce6f320c9b6c8a1","name":"黄强","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/huang-qiang"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":218,"end_new_line":218,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":178738991,"discussion_id":"fdff3b45cdcde44ae84ff2770dcb97226e695b93","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-07-06T16:42:26+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T16:42:26+08:00","user":{"id":"68d502180329437872e54496","login":"gcw_kUomxQ2l","object_id":"68d502180329437872e54496","name":"liulun0308","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gcw_kUomxQ2l"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178740147,"discussion_id":"993c22c710942d011579a3091513daae4bab1bf3","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-07-06T16:46:11+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T16:46:11+08:00","user":{"id":"6880d13aba419813105ac7ab","login":"tangweiwei2","object_id":"6880d13aba419813105ac7ab","name":"tangweiwei2","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178740242,"discussion_id":"73caa30b3148165d68532ded4e2dd23a09cb948e","body":"Pull Request 已合并或已关闭。\n\nIf you want to solve this problem, [you can click here to do it in the **<font color=red>_FAQs_</font>**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-faq).","created_at":"2026-07-06T16:46:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T16:46:35+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"}]